cff-version: 1.2.0
title: GenoPilot
message: >-
  If you use GenoPilot in your research, please cite the
  exact version you used.
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Oberwasserlechner
    given-names: Michael
    orcid: 'https://orcid.org/0009-0009-4799-0666'
    affiliation: BYTEOWLS Software & Consulting
    email: m.oberwasserlechner@byteowls.com
repository-code: 'https://github.com/BYTEOWLS/genopilot'
repository-artifact: 'https://www.npmjs.com/package/@byteowls/genopilot'
abstract: >-
  Guided, reproducible genome workflows: curated Snakemake
  pipelines you configure and run from the terminal. Tools
  are pinned, and results are aggregated and shown in a
  structured browser view.
keywords:
  - bioinformatics
  - genomics
  - reproducibility
  - Snakemake
  - consensus genome
  - annotation transfer
  - terminal user interface
